Package: aegis-icons
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Aegis OS squircle icon theme
 The user-designed squircle icon language (proposal plate 09): every app
 icon (settings, store, music, terminal, files, corex, ...), places and
 devices on one shared squircle mask + sheen + hairline. Default theme of
 AEGIS OS; falls back to the cutefish icon theme for generic glyphs.
